  date         = {2014-06-12},
  abstract     = {Although crizotinib demonstrates robust efficacy in anaplastic
                  lymphoma kinase (ALK)-positive non-small-cell lung carcinoma
                  patients, progression during treatment eventually develops.
                  Resistant patient samples revealed a variety of point
                  mutations in the kinase domain of ALK, including the L1196M
