  pages        = {e12778},
  date         = {2021-08},
  abstract     = {BACKGROUND: Weight loss in children and adolescents with type
                  2 diabetes (T2D) is associated with improved glycaemic
                  control. OBJECTIVES: To assess the effects of liraglutide vs
                  placebo on body mass index (BMI) and weight parameters in
                  children and adolescents with T2D using data from the ellipse
