  pages        = {389--403},
  date         = {2016-01-15},
  abstract     = {A large number of genetic loci are associated with adult body
                  mass index. However, the genetics of childhood body mass index
                  are largely unknown. We performed a meta-analysis of
                  genome-wide association studies of childhood body mass index,
                  using sex- and age-adjusted standard deviation scores. We
