  pages        = {723--740},
  date         = {2022-03-10},
  abstract     = {CONTEXT: Prolonged high salt (sodium) intake can increase the
                  risk of hypertension and cardiovascular disease. Behavioral
                  interventions may help reduce sodium intake at the population
                  level. OBJECTIVE: The effectiveness of behavior change
                  interventions to reduce sodium intake in adults was
