  date         = {2022-03-01},
  abstract     = {OBJECTIVE Type 2 diabetes (T2D) has heterogeneous patient
                  clinical characteristics and outcomes. In previous work, we
                  investigated the genetic basis of this heterogeneity by
                  clustering 94 T2D genetic loci using their associations with
                  47 diabetes-related traits and identified five clusters,
