                  253,810 singletons in 16 birth cohort studies},
  author       = {Vinther, Johan L and Cadman, Tim and Avraam, Demetris and
                  Ekstrøm, Claus T and I A Sørensen, Thorkild and Elhakeem,
                  Ahmed and Santos, Ana C and Pinot de Moira, Angela and Heude,
