                  poor families. One‐third of the children were breastfed until
                  6 months of age, one‐half were born by cesarean section,
                  63.9\% had used medication in the previous 15 days, 26.4\%
                  experienced hospitalization at least once since birth, and
                  14\% had no updated vaccination; asthma/bronchitis (20.4\%)
