                  cholesterol, the estimate from observational epidemiology (a 1
                  SD increase in LDL cholesterol associated with OR 1·54, 95\%
                  CI 1·45-1·63) was concordant with that from genetic score (OR
                  2·13, 95\% CI 1·69-2·69, p=2×10(-10)). INTERPRETATION: Some
