  date         = {2021-05-04},
  abstract     = {The beta-interferons are widely prescribed platform therapies
                  for patients with multiple sclerosis (MS). We accessed a
                  cohort of patients with relapsing-onset MS from British
                  Columbia, Canada (1995-2013), to examine the potential
                  survival advantage associated with beta-interferon exposure
